# Panes, a file tree and floating terminals, as a terminal multiplexer
# has them, in the editor.
size 1280 800
hide
keys :
type open README.md
keys enter
wait-for Shop
show
wait 1
keys space e
wait 1.5
keys alt-l
wait 0.5
keys alt-n
wait 1.5
type cat README.md
keys enter
wait 1.5
keys alt-f
wait 1.5
type git --version
keys enter
wait 1.5
keys alt-w
wait 1.5
shot panes
keys alt-f
wait 1.5
